# OpenCode ONLY, free models. No Google or OpenRouter key needed.
# Roles:
# - PLAN   : deepseek-v4.1-flash-free (best reasoning of the free set, zero-retention).
# - BUILD  : glm-5.3-flash-free (zero-retention, different family from planner).
# - REVIEW : nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free (NVIDIA family, different from builder).
# - TEST   : nemotron-3.5-lightning-free (fast).
# Notes:
# - OpenCode free models are "free for a limited time" and can change or disappear: re-check with `opencode models opencode`.
# - Avoid big-pickle and the mimo models for private code (may be used for training).
# - Untested/unfamiliar options if you want to experiment: longcat-2.5-free, flint-40b-free,
#   iceman-free, beam-free, inkling-2-small-free.
PLAN_MODEL=opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free
BUILD_MODEL=opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free
REVIEW_MODEL=opencode/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free
TEST_MODEL=opencode/nemotron-3.5-lightning-free
